WEBVTT

00:02:58.658 --> 00:03:01.851
Similarly, compressed oxygen
and other medical supplies

00:03:01.875 --> 00:03:03.057
are really a luxury,

00:03:03.081 --> 00:03:06.363
and can often be out of stock
for months or even a year.

00:03:06.387 --> 00:03:09.551
So it seems crazy, but the model
that we have right now

00:03:09.575 --> 00:03:11.780
is taking those machines
that were designed

00:03:11.804 --> 00:03:14.087
for that first environment
that I showed you

00:03:14.111 --> 00:03:17.975
and donating or selling them
to hospitals in this environment.

00:03:18.861 --> 00:03:20.437
It's not just inappropriate,

00:03:20.461 --> 00:03:22.999
it becomes really unsafe.

00:03:23.516 --> 00:03:25.438
One of our partners at Johns Hopkins

00:03:25.462 --> 00:03:29.641
was observing surgeries in Sierra Leone
about a year ago.